  "description": "I created a catalogue of 5 artists, by guiding the player through a virtual art gallery. During the experience each work of art is enhanced in some way, but without altering its identity. The experience is about 5 minutes long and is best experienced seated or standing with the audio turned up!\n\r\n\n\r\n*************WHEN YOU RUN IT PRESS THE SPACE BAR TO CALIBRATE YOUR POSITION*************\n\r\n\n\r\n****To close press ALT+F4****\n\r\n\n\r\nThe artists:\n\r\n\n\r\n1. Rachel Ara\n\r\n2. Jacek Ludwig Scarso\n\r\n3. Ian Chamberlin\n\r\n4. Nemo Nonnenmacher\n\r\n5. Scarlet Mueller\n\r\n\n\r\nLet me know what you think!\n\r\n\n\r\nCheers,\n\r\nFelix",
